<div class="post-info"><h2 class="post-title"><a href="http://www.marksportal.net/blog/?p=48" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Spontaneous Redesign">Spontaneous Redesign</a></h2>
Posted by Mark under <a href="http://www.marksportal.net/blog/index.php?cat=1" title="View all posts in General" rel="category tag">General</a><br/><a href="http://www.marksportal.net/blog/?p=48#comments">No Comments</a>&nbsp;</div>
<div class="post-content">
		<p>Funny how so many good things I do end up being spontaneous.  Take this website redesign.  Earlier last week I had no intentions of spending my time on it, yet all of a sudden I found myself working on it Saturday afternoon.   Then by Sunday evening, I had completely changed everything and am VERY please with how it has turned out.   I still need to work on making the photo gallery flow better with the front page, but I&#8217;ll hit that another time.  It&#8217;s not that important.
</p>
	<p class="post-info">
													
	</p>
